<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  AI-assisted security and compliance review of pull requests. Adds the
  <code>aiPrReview</code> pipeline step, which runs a shared review engine
  (Claude, Codex, or Copilot; public API, Bedrock, Vertex, or a custom
  gateway) inside a Docker sandbox with default-deny egress, and posts the
  findings as inline PR comments.
</div>
